{"sections":[{"slug":"松幺半函子","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"松幺半函子"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">松幺半函子</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"松幺半函子"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">松幺半函子是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">之间的一种态射</span> $F \\colon \\mathcal C \\to\\mathcal D$, <span lang=\"zh\">它不一定是函子</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">因为它不要求保持幺半结构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而是要求具有某些单方向的态射</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">例如</span>\n$$\r\n F(X) \\otimes F(Y) \\to F(X \\otimes Y) .\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">这些态射不一定可逆</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">若将幺半范畴视为单对象</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathbf{B}\\mathcal C$, <span lang=\"zh\">则松幺半函子是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/松函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">松函子</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的特例</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于幺半范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$, <span lang=\"zh\">松幺半函子</span> $1\\to \\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">等同于</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}